4
00:00:12.064 --> 00:00:15.937
Today we learn about My Personal Health Plan. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.970 --> 00:00:20.687
Health plan. Say it with me. Health plan!

6
00:00:24.171 --> 00:00:27.554
Physical. Say it with me. Physical!

7
00:00:31.070 --> 00:00:33.953
Mental. Say it with me. Mental!

8
00:00:37.483 --> 00:00:40.883
Social. Say it with me. Social!

9
00:00:44.347 --> 00:00:47.347
Goals. Say it with me. Goals!

10
00:00:50.822 --> 00:00:54.322
Habits. Say it with me. Habits!

11
00:00:57.802 --> 00:01:00.935
Track. Say it with me. Track!

12
00:01:04.455 --> 00:01:07.688
