13
00:01:11.242 --> 00:01:18.934
A personal health plan covers physical, mental, and social health. I set goals, build habits, track progress, and review my plan every month.

14
00:01:18.984 --> 00:01:21.781
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:23.090 --> 00:01:28.409
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:28.459 --> 00:01:29.609
Mental!

17
00:01:30.485 --> 00:01:35.624
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:35.674 --> 00:01:36.700
Track!

19
00:01:37.409 --> 00:01:42.354
Did you know? Health includes your body, mind and relationships — they all affect each other!

20
00:01:42.404 --> 00:01:44.248
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:45.556 --> 00:01:53.305
Think and answer. Which part of your health needs the most attention?

22
00:01:53.355 --> 00:01:54.505
Great answer!

23
00:01:55.547 --> 00:02:02.043
Excellent work, everyone! You finished Health Grade 9. Keep caring for your body and mind. Goodbye!

24
